oramio.jpg","w":1200,"h":900,"author":"George Wenn","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96%E5%B9%BF%E5%9C%BA%5Emy_bike_-_panoramio.jpg"}},{"id":"changchun_wv_x3856e656","areaId":"changchun","name":"文化广场","category":"landmark","tags":["photo"],"location":{"lat":43.87743,"lng":125.3013},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"changchun_wv_x3856e656","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsNearby":29,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-22"},"hashtags":["文化广场changchun","changchun"],"summary":"这是一个令人愉快的城市休闲场所。广场被几个伪满时代的历史建筑所包围。在广场的北端坐落着雄伟的伪满皇帝新宫，它是为了取代上一个伪满皇宫。 广场南端是原伪满国务院和军事大楼。这些建筑现在隶属于吉林大学，也是20世纪早期日本建筑的典范。在广场上，小贩们出售风筝和各种其他产品。许多人也会在这个广场上放风筝，而其他人则演奏乐器或只是坐着休息。更正式的表演有时会在高中附近搭建的临时舞台上举行。对于来长春的散客来说，这可能是一个乘出租车参观的好地方。","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"zh:长春","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f1/%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96%E5%B9%BF%E5%9C%BA%5Emy_bike_-_panoramio.jpg/1280px-%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96%E5%B9%BF%E5%9C%BA%5Emy_bike_-_panoramio.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f1/%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96%E5%B9%BF%E5%9C%BA%5Emy_bike_-_panoramio.jpg/500px-%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96%E5%B9%BF%E5%9C%BA%5Emy_bike_-_panoramio.jpg","w":1200,"h":900,"author":"George Wenn","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96%E5%B9%BF%E5%9C%BA%5Emy_bike_-_panoramio.jpg"}},{"id":"changchun_wv_mayflower_bar","areaId":"changchun","name":"Mayflower Bar","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":43.87993,"lng":125.3268},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"changchun_wv_mayflower_bar","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["mayflowerbar","changchun"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"It's been said this is the hottest club in town, and that the \"old Mayflower\" is simply the best. There are two rooms. In the outer room there is a live show daily from 21:00, and after that the DJ plays disco. The inner room is small but quite popular. It plays hip-hop and it gets out of control after 13:00. The third Mayflower bar was opened in the basement of the Shangri-La hotel. Here it's sim","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Changchun"},{"id":"changchun_wv_three_monkeys","areaId":"changchun","name":"Three Monkeys","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":43.83342,"lng":125.27604},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"changchun_wv_three_monkeys","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["threemonkeys","changchun"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"The interior, music collection, drinks menu and all other aspects of the pub were designed by British, Italian and American engineers. The music is all western and the drinks menu includes English ale and Irish stout. This is the only place in Changchun to have a beer and a game of pool in peace. A front terrace away from the main road to have a beer on a summers evening in pleasant surroundings.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Changchun"},{"id":"changchun_wv_old_ship_bar","areaId":"changchun","name":"Old Ship Bar","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":43.85571,"lng":125.23047},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"changchun_wv_old_ship_bar","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["oldshipbar","changchun"],"